#
# Host gate pages (SHEETSCOPE 5/5, SHEETSCOPE-UNB 5/5, SHEETSCOPE-Q 3/3):
# class-anchored insertRule append, anchored behind a sibling step, a
# sibling-escaping selector, a removed rule (anchor from the old side), a
# common body{} rule left alone; @font-face, counter-increment, nesting,
# statement @layer, the body{} rule itself; quirks .Foo vs class="foo",
